    "salt and pepper (to taste)",
    "1/2 teaspoon garlic powder",
    "1/2 teaspoon cumin"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Gather and prep all of your ingredients.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/easy-keto-pulled-mexican-chicken/#wprm-recipe-56607-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Two-ingredient-Mexican-Pulled-Chicken-1.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the chicken thighs to a slow cooker and season with salt and pepper.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/easy-keto-pulled-mexican-chicken/#wprm-recipe-56607-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Two-ingredient-Mexican-Pulled-Chicken-2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the salsa on top of the chicken, then mix together. Cook on low for 3-4 hours.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/easy-keto-pulled-mexican-chicken/#wprm-recipe-56607-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Two-ingredient-Mexican-Pulled-Chicken-3.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove the chicken thighs from the slow cooker and shred the meat using 2 forks.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/easy-keto-pulled-mexican-chicken/#wprm-recipe-56607-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Two-ingredient-Mexican-Pulled-Chicken-4.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Return the shredded chicken to the slow cooker and cook on low for an additional 10 minutes.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/easy-keto-pulled-mexican-chicken/#wprm-recipe-56607-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Two-ingredient-Mexican-Pulled-Chicken-5.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add cauliflower rice and olive oil to a pan over medium-high heat. Season with garlic powder, cumin, and salt and pepper to taste. Cook for 7-8 minutes, stirring frequently, until cauliflower rice is your preferred texture.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/easy-keto-pulled-mexican-chicken/#wprm-recipe-56607-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Two-ingredient-Mexican-Pulled-Chicken-6.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve pulled chicken over the cauliflower rice. Garnish with chopped cilantro if desired. Enjoy!",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/easy-keto-pulled-mexican-chicken/#wprm-recipe-56607-step-0-6",
